.TH WERKMEISTER-PR-NEW 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-pr\-new \- Start a follow\-up PR file and branch for a worktree whose PRs have merged
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister pr new\fR [worktree]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-slug <slug>\fR
The follow\-up's name, in its PR file and branch
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the result as JSON
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
